OL,5,G1300 Murder She Wrote
OL,6,     FA beautiful young woman becomes
OL,7,     Fskipper of her father's racing
OL,8,     Fyacht, but when her racing rival
OL,9,     Fis found murdered, Jessica must
OL,10,     Ftry to solve the case.
OL,11,G1400 Murder She Wrote
OL,12,     FJohnny is engaged to Seth's niece
OL,13,     FAmy. When he becomes the victim of
OL,14,     Fa motorcycle accident, Amy insists
OL,15,     Fthat it was murder.
OL,16,G1500 Columbo: Short Fuse
OL,17,     FCrime drama starring Peter Falk
OL,18,     Fand Roddy McDowall. A smokescreen
OL,19,     Fof lies hinders Columbo's
OL,20,     Finvestigation when a businessman
OL,21,     Fand his chauffeur are murdered.
OL,22,     F(1972)
