OL,5,G0205 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
OL,6,     FIn the new series, as well as
OL,7,     Ftackling canine behavioural
OL,8,     Fissues, Graeme Hall opens his new
OL,9,     Fpuppy school. Plus, a hellhound
OL,10,     Fwho's tearing a family apart, and
OL,11,     Fviewers' doggie dilemmas.
OL,12,G0310 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,13,     FBen ventures to the 'Emerald Isle'
OL,14,     Fto visit Georg and Bettina, an
OL,15,     Felderly European couple (from
OL,16,     FAustria and Germany) who made the
OL,17,     FIrish wilderness their home nearly
OL,18,     F40 years ago.
